# {{ mod_name }}

A Galaxy on Fire 2 PC 2D-render hook starter by {{ author_name }}.

Generate into `{{ mod_id | snake_case }}`, then copy that folder beneath the
game's `mods` directory. `init.lua` hooks the ModAPI main-menu and in-game 2D
render entry points and preserves each original call with `ctx:call()`.

The sample intentionally draws text only. If you add images, create the asset
through the ModAPI and pass its sprite ID to `ctx:DrawImage2D`.

Open the generated folder in Visual Studio Code and install its recommended
Lua extension for typed hook contexts, hook-name suggestions, signatures, and
hover documentation. See `MODAPI-DEVELOPMENT.md`.

The generated Lua source is GPL-3.0-only. Klonker does not install, execute,
or manage it after generation.
